<title>NEW ZEALAND: New Zealand dollar closes unchanged.</title>
<headline>New Zealand dollar closes unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand dollar closed unchanged in uneventful pre-holiday trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dealers said Japanese investors showed buying interest, perhaps in relation to fresh samurai bond issuance, but the kiwi remained in a US$0.7070-85 range.</p>
<p>It closed at 0.7072/79, unchanged from its opening. The Trade-Weighted Index finished at 67.28 from its 67.37 opening.</p>
<p>-- Simon Louisson 64 4 4734 746</p>
